# API layer

`src/api/football_data.rs` is the thin HTTP wrapper around football-data.org.

**Belongs in `api/`:**
- `FootballDataApi` methods that map to endpoints
- `ApiError`, rate-limit handling
- Serde structs matching API JSON (`Team`, `Match`, `SquadPlayer`, `Scorer`)

**Belongs in `soccar.rs` (not `api/`):**
- `find_team`, `find_players`
- `fetch_squads_for_teams` (multi-call orchestration + role filter)
- `full_time_score` (interpreting nullable API score fields)
- `SquadPlayerMatch`

Call sites use `ctx.data().soccar_api()` or `data.soccar_api()`.
